cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Si utiliza fhirviews, cite la version exacta del software. La version
  0.5.0.9000 es de desarrollo; el DOI de Zenodo se incorporara cuando
  exista un deposito publicado y verificado.
type: software
title: "fhirviews: FHIR desde R y vistas tabulares con SQL on FHIR"
version: 0.5.0.9000
authors:
  - family-names: "Salas Guerrero"
    given-names: "Ronald Fabricio"
    email: "fabriciosalasguerrero@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5077-1522"
repository-code: "https://github.com/f-slg/fhirviews"
url: "https://f-slg.github.io/fhirviews/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - SQL on FHIR
  - FHIRPath
  - R
  - interoperability
abstract: >-
  R client for FHIR R4 servers and SQL on FHIR view engine, with explicit
  mappings from SQL query results and R tables to Patient, Observation,
  Encounter, Condition and Immunization resources. Supports JSON and NDJSON
  output, decimal precision, R4 structural checks and server profile validation.
